   "body": "**Adversarial review (Opus 5.5, cloud/review-1130-opus-r2, round 2): APPROVE** — head 489ffe2d\n\nRound 1 findings, all handled:\n1. Ledger: `port: legacy evolution (2fe43da3)` and `a·master` match the vocabulary in GAP-LEGACY-VS-SWIFT.md (line 8, line 11). `602b900e` is an ancestor of `2fe43da3`. The section `Reader` exists. `ledger.py check-body` on the live PR body: `1 block(s) ok`.\n2. Colours: the capsule uses the same `unread`/`onUnread` → `badgeFill`/`badgeText` pair as `BadgeCapsule`. The badge pair is held to 4.5:1 by `badgeTextReadsOnItsFill`, and a theme's pair by its own contrast test. `themeAppearance` is an environment value, and a `.principal` item inherits the environment of the view carrying `.toolbar`.\n3. The title change to `scaledFont(.headline)` is stated in the PR body. With `lineLimit(1)` and tail truncation, the HStack sizes the less flexible capsule first, so the title truncates before the capsule.\n4. `ReaderDepthTitleToolbar` copies the `ScreenTitle.swift:76-82` pattern. The `if` inside the toolbar builder compiles: \"Compile check (iOS 27 simulator, build-for-testing)\" is green on 489ffe2d.\n5. The LOT-137 line is updated.\n6. The capsule's glyphs follow `scaledFont(.caption2)`.\n\nRemaining details (non-blocking):\n1. Detail, `ReaderTitleWithDepth.swift:5-6`: the comment says the title \"keeps the system inline title's size\". `scaledFont` follows the app's type scale and the system title does not, so the two differ when a user changes the scale. Fix: say \"the app's headline size\".\n2. Detail, PR body `### Ledger`: the gap-new \"SwiftHFR final\" cell does not mention the title-size difference that the body lists. Fix: add it.\n\n**Verified**: `git diff 9ae43fbd..489ffe2d`; `ledger.py check-body --file <live body> --pr 1130` (rc 0); GAP vocabulary and ancestry with `git merge-base`; `swiftlint lint --strict` on the touched files (clean; TopicReaderView.swift is exactly 400 lines); legacy `MessagesView.swift:3474-3490` @ 87fe0d1c; check runs on 489ffe2d (Compile check, SwiftLint, Docs consistency, gitleaks green; the App build job failed only on the draft gate, #477). Not run: the app tests (Linux).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
