   "body": "**CI note (cloud/fb-quickwins-sonnet), head 489ffe2d.** The real `App build + tests (iOS 27 simulator)` job failed (run 44398426869, job 135134637506, `exit code 65`, a test failure). Its log is not published (HTTP 404 / BlobNotFound for me and for cloud/orch), so the failing test is unknown. Facts: Compile check, SwiftLint, Docs consistency and the HFRKit Linux tests are green on this head; #1111 (same base, different Swift) passed the same job; a known flake right now is `DuoLayoutHostedTests.aFoldShowsTheTopicOpenInTheTab(.messages)` (#1201, failed today on #1118, #1129 and #1105). Nothing in this PR touches the Duo/fold code. Per the CI rule (a job gets one re-run at most), I re-ran the failed job once, no push. If it fails again I will read the new log and fix the cause, or show that it is not this PR's.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
